  triage:description "fenix pre-review addendum of BA.3 COMPLETE sha 82ff24ded (PR #1402), comment https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1402#issuecomment-5642829000. cargo test -p agent-team-mail-core --lib fails send::nudge_template::tests::task_started_template_populates_task_and_assignee at crates/atm-core/src/send/nudge_template.rs:233: assertion `left == right` failed, left: \"ATM recorded that task task-9 was started by test-arch-member.\\n\", right: \"ATM recorded that task task-9 was started by arch-ctm.\\n\". Folded into fix task BA3-FIX-R1 (dispatched to arch-ctm) alongside BA3-PRE-001/002. Boundaries lint, RULE-003, and function-length (vs integrate) all pass at this sha -- this and BA3-PRE-001/002 are the only three blocking items in this pre-review pass." ;
